moment-LP_R(consec_k) = exact max p_0 given S_1..S_R  vs cap_k.  Smallest R that closes k.
====================================================================================================
  k     LP_R=2     LP_R=3     LP_R=4     LP_R=5     LP_R=6    meas S7      cap_k  minR<=cap
